const QUOTES = [
"The only way to do great work is to love what you do, and if you have not found it yet, keep looking.",
"In the middle of every difficulty lies opportunity, waiting patiently for someone willing to notice it.",
"Success is not final, failure is not fatal, it is the courage to continue that truly counts.",
